    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "⚡ **What Makes a \"Holy Sh*t\" Demo**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your CRDT education animation idea would work **IF** you can answer these during the demo:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **\"Who desperately needs this?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Bad answer:** \"Students learning CRDTs\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Good answer:** \"CS professors who teach distributed systems. They waste 10 hours making lecture animations. We do it in 2 minutes. Here's Stanford's syllabus—8 topics need animations. We just made all 8.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **\"Why can't someone else build this?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Bad answer:** \"We use AI\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Good answer:** \"We built a domain-specific animation engine for technical concepts. Watch how it handles state machines, network protocols, data structures. Canva can't do this. After Effects takes 10 hours per video. We do it in minutes.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **\"What's the wedge?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Bad answer:** \"Education market is huge\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Good answer:** \"We're starting with CS education (30k professors globally). They already pay for lecture tools. Expansion: medical education, engineering, any field with complex visual explanations.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **\"Will anyone pay?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Bad answer:** \"We think so\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Good answer:** \"We showed this to 5 CS professors. 4 asked for access. 1 said their department has a $50k/year budget for course materials. Here's their email.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
