    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Raft consensus"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Byzantine Fault Tolerance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-112",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- (Shows it's not one-off magic)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-113",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Record the demo video** (2 minutes max)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-114",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Show input → output"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Play the generated animation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Emphasize speed (10 hours → 2 minutes)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Show 3 CS professors**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Screen share, watch them react"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Record their feedback"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-120",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Ask: \"Would you use this? Would your department pay?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-121",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "YC Application:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-122",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Video**: Show the demo working (not just talking about it)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-123",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Traction**: \"0 users, but showed to 5 professors, 4 want access, here's their feedback\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-124",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Vision**: \"Start with CS education, expand to any technical education\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-125",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Why you**: \"I taught [X], wasted [Y] hours on lecture videos\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "⚠️ **The Risk with Demo-First Approach**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "YC will ask:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-130",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**\"Cool demo. But will anyone actually use this?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-131",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You need to answer:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-132",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Yes—here's proof I talked to professors\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-133",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Yes—here's their pain point (cite hours wasted)\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-134",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Yes—here's their budget for solutions\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you can't answer that:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-137",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Then you're just showing off tech, not solving a problem."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**That's why I still recommend:** Ship something simple, get 2-3 users, THEN make the crazy demo."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🔥 **Best of Both Worlds**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Ideal scenario for YC:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Ship basic version** (manual animations, no AI script generation)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-143",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Get 3 professors using it** (even if it's clunky)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-144",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **They ask: \"Can you auto-generate the script?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **You build the CRDT demo in response** (now it's user-driven)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-146",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Show it to them, they go crazy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-147",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Apply to YC with:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-148",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"We have 3 users\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"They asked for this feature\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"We built it, watch this demo\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-151",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- \"Now they can't live without it\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-152",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**That's a 90% YC application.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-153",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-154",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "📊 **Decision Matrix**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-155",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Scenario | YC Acceptance Odds | What You Need |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-156",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-157",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Zero users, no demo | 5% | Hope + incredible founder story |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-158",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Zero users, impressive demo | 40% | Demo + evidence people want it |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-159",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| 3 users, no impressive demo | 50% | Retention + growth signal |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| 3 users, impressive demo | 75% | Both paths converge = strong |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-161",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| 10 users, impressive demo, revenue | 90% | Slam dunk |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-162",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-163",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🎯 **My Updated Advice**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**If the CRDT demo is:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-165",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "✅ Technically impressive (AI script + animation + narration)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-166",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "✅ Fast to show (2-minute video)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-167",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "✅ Clearly valuable (saves 10 hours)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-168",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "✅ Validated by 3-5 professors (feedback quotes)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Then YES—apply to YC with just the demo.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**BUT:** Don't skip the validation. Show it to professors. Get quotes. Ask if they'd pay."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Without validation, it's just a cool tech demo.** YC has seen 10,000 cool tech demos."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-173",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**With validation, it's proof of a billion-dollar market.** That's what gets you in."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-174",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**So: Build the CRDT demo. But show it to 5 CS professors BEFORE applying. Get their reactions on video. That's your YC application.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Does that make sense? The demo can work, but you still need to prove **someone desperately wants this**."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}